list.item:
The following general principles shall be proposed to the air conference,
                        for adoption and inclusion in a draft convention: 
                            (a)

non-exclusivity;
                            (b)

reservation of cabotage;
                            (c)

curtailment of subsidies;
                            (d)

right of countries to pool operations;


                            (e)

use of airports and facilities on a non-discriminatory
                                basis;
                            (f)

cooperative handling of isolated airports;
                            (g)

non-discriminatory handling of prohibited areas, customs
                                regulations, et cetera.
